OL,3,AIsraeli strike on Gaza hospital kills
OL,4,Asix Palestinians, health ministry says
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix people have been killed and about
OL,7,F20 injured in an Israeli air strike on
OL,8,FNasser hospital in the southern Gaza
OL,9,FStrip, the Hamas-run health ministry
OL,10,Fsays.
OL,12,FThe hospital's director said two
OL,13,Fmissiles hit a building containing
OL,14,Fsurgical wards and intensive care units
OL,15,Fovernight, but that one of the missiles
OL,16,Fdid not explode.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
