OL,3,AIsraeli strike on Gaza hospital kills
OL,4,Asix Palestinians, health ministry says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe health ministry said medical staff,
OL,7,Fpatients and companions were killed,
OL,8,Famong them surgeon Dr Rizq Abu Shaira.
OL,9,FIt condemned the attack as a "flagrant
OL,10,Fviolation of international laws and
OL,11,Fconventions".
OL,13,FThe Israeli military said it targeted a
OL,14,Fcommander of Hamas's armed wing and
OL,15,Fother fighters who had used the
OL,16,Fhospital as a "headquarters" to plan
OL,17,Fattacks on its forces.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
